 "defend": true,
 "desc": "One of the improved variations of the Principality of Zeon's mass-produced ground combat mobile suit Gouf produced in the middle and late stages of the One Year War.\nThis machine boasted vastly improved long-range offense, maneuverability, and maintenance.\nThe 5-barrel 75mm machine gun in its left hand was changed to a normal manipulator, while the right hand's built-in heat rod was wired to reduce overall weight.\nThe reduced firepower could be supplemented with a triple 35mm gatling cannon, a gatling shield able to mount a heat saber, and other optional equipment that made the machine a force to be reckoned with in ground combat.\nThe few units produced were primarily given to ace pilots, who used them to great success on the battlefield.",
 "evade": true,
