    "character_status_id": 1013001100,
    "desc": "An ace pilot of the Zeon forces who has sworn loyalty to the noble Sakhalin family.\nHe is in charge of defending the development base and other military duties while Ginius Sakhalin focuses on the development of his prototype mobile armor Apsaras.\nHe is a veteran soldier who has won the trust of others through his dedication.\nRather than a blind zealot, he is more like a samurai, taking his loyalty incredibly seriously.\nHe feels a strong dislike towards Ginius Sakhalin for his cruelty, but adores Aina Sakhalin and is like a father figure to her.\nUltimately, he grants Aina's wish by boarding his Gouf Custom and heading out on a solo mission to put up a fierce fight against the attacking Federation Forces, including the 08th MS Team.",
